<title>USA: U.S. December employment data to be issued Jan 10.</title>
<headline>U.S. December employment data to be issued Jan 10.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Labor Department confirmed Wednesday that it will issue the December employment report on Jan. 10.</p>
<p>The monthly employment figures are usually issued on the first Friday of the month, but due to the New Year's Day holiday, which falls on the Wednesday prior to the first Friday in January, the report will be issued the following Friday.</p>
